WEBVTT

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.070
First, you say hello.

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:20.320
You look like fun. You look like fun, Slash!

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:21.690
Dan!

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:26.410
Can you run away from me?

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:28.370
Moron! I'm not running!

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.250
Dan, awesome!

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.660
There's more to basketball than running in a straight line!

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:39.420
Rouge!

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:40.970
Okay!

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:50.750
This is the end.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:53.150
Prepare to fire the Legend Bullet.

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:58.400
So you're lowering the curtain on this play yourself?

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:01.070
The video feed is broken with static...

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:03.970
Their farcical ball game will never be more than an unsightly parody...

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:08.770
...where they clown around until our very moment of despair.

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:10.790
What a load of crap! {alt tl: You must be kidding me!}

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:14.260
The gods don't extend their hands to everyone.

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:17.220
They show the signs only to those who uphold their will.

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.840
You can't play hero and expect to save the world.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.050
You're not too bad now yourself.

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:26.930
Better take me seriously!

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:28.730
Iceman!

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.310
Destroy!

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:33.390
What?!

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:34.770
Don't forget about me!

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.020
Awesome, Sela!

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:42.110
Sela, nice one.

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:43.780
Good going, Sela.

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:51.540
Even though my mech moves so well...

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:54.690
Even though it does exactly what I ask it to...

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:55.790
Goddammit!

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:58.930
Look, Gramps!

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:00.460
There at Dangan's feet!

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:04.440
The mech itself is new, but those are the old shoes.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.750
We don't have any more spares!

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:13.930
I can keep going!

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:15.440
Slash?

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.520
It's catching up with me already?

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:21.490
Not yet!

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:22.280
Not yet!

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:24.320
There's something up with him!

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:25.160
I know!

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:25.910
This play...

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:26.910
These steps...

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:31.120
Oh!

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:35.410
It was you!

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.500
They're going all out.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.210
True.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:42.310
Still...

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:46.900
Show me...

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:48.930
Show me the legend!

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.890
Show me the thunderbolt's power!

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.420
Hold on...

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:55.270
This can't be all there is to my power!

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:02.910
You're shaking.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.820
Hard as it may be to believe, I'm human too.

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:12.410
Time to make a legend.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.940
Starting Legend Bullet launch sequence.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:19.400
Countdown to Cannon blast ignition.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:20.750
Ten... Nine...

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:23.710
Look at that!

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:30.800
Come on, Dan.

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:32.620
Let's go for it!

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:38.900
They're incredible.

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.010
But I'm not done yet...

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.020
I'm here too!

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:45.190
Rouge?

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:46.730
I see.

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:48.610
She's like Slash.

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:50.630
Though they differ in extent,

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:53.700
she's undergone reinforcement just like him.

00:03:58.640 --> 00:03:59.250
Not bad.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:13.880
What's that?

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.910
The Legend Bullet!

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:19.000
I hear them.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:22.270
I hear their voices.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:26.080
Confirmed ballistic launch from the Skybloom Kingdom!

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:27.480
They're early!

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:27.530
They're early!

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.900
The Legend Bullet has escaped Earthdash's atmosphere.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.480
Collision trajectory to Mooneyes is clear!

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:38.120
So long,

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:40.540
moon!

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:42.860
Stones... Colors...

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:46.360
A power flattened ruthlessly under heel.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:56.920
There's strength flowing through me...

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:58.100
Dan!

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.110
Yeah.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.440
Here we go, Rouge!

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:12.260
Penetration of the Lunar Interceptor System confirmed!

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:13.410
Naturally.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:15.740
What?

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:16.710
Dan!

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:17.690
Got it!

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:21.750
Dan!

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:23.420
End it!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:24.920
I will! You watch, Rouge!

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:28.420
Something is falling towards us.

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.810
That damned Yan.

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:32.980
Don't worry.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:34.190
Mr. Slash?

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:37.220
Flora, daughter of my younger brother Regalia.

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:38.970
I will strike it down.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:41.570
Father is your younger brother?

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:42.740
You...

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:43.690
Brother!

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.060
You are my elder brother, after all!

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:55.410
Not yet!

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.240
I have to...!

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:06.070
Slash!

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:08.600
Dan!

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:14.880
Basquash!

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.620
Dan...

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:39.200
That was truly fine.

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:47.090
You <i>are</i> the legend.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:04.840
Good going, Dan!

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:06.610
The manas is gushing up...

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:09.530
I feel an overflowing power.

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:12.110
Earthdash and the moon...

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:16.610
Their ultimite is resonating back and forth.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:20.020
Slash...

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.760
The power... vanished?

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.130
H-Huh?

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:39.050
I guess you're the wrong one.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.870
I'm... the wrong one?

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:57.710
What's that?

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:00.640
It must be the Legend Bullet that Yan launched.

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.990
Slash... No, Ascend, the old king of the moon,

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:07.760
sacrificed himself to change the Bullet's orbit.

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.050
King of the moon...

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.130
Father's older brother...

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:16.480
The Legend Bullet is now in lunar orbit.

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.420
It failed.

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:19.600
Failed? Why?

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.750
There must have been some obstacle.

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:24.620
Something sufficient to push the Bullet into orbit.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:27.940
That can't be... It was our last hope...

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:31.650
What's the deal?

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:34.980
I made a kick-ass dunk.

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:41.740
I thought I was supposed to save the world...

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:43.020
Dan...

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:46.160
Sela, look!

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:07.730
Princess!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.040
Princess Flora!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.260
Jiiya! Baaya!

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.450
Well done.

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:15.610
Is something amiss?

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.120
I'm sorry. It looks like we're too late.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:24.410
Dan.

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:27.170
So you're alive, huh, Navi?

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:28.870
I'm glad.

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:31.370
Thank James.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.970
I'm not the guy.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.590
I see. That's too bad.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:40.600
Navi.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:41.460
Sela.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:43.480
I'm glad to see you.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:44.640
Me too.

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:48.230
Even with the surface and the moon like they are...

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:51.740
No, even now that it's all come to this, the fact I could see you again...

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.820
I know... it must...

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:56.570
Sela.

00:09:58.720 --> 00:09:59.610
Navi...

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:01.620
Hey, Navi...

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:05.880
Are we all gonna die now?

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:08.070
Do we just give up?

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:09.270
It's not fair...

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:12.950
I mean, we're still alive.

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:15.130
We're alive.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:20.840
What is it?

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.370
Oh yeah, that's right.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:51.950
I'm me.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:54.660
Navi!

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:56.760
Gimme those shoes.

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:14.350
Here I come.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:15.350
And this time, I swear...

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:17.730
Let's settle things, Dan!

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:28.490
Destroy!

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:30.970
Basquash!

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.960
What's the use of basketball now?

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:38.710
Still...

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:40.670
Still...

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:42.000
It's amazing...

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:52.020
ame ga agatta ato no nioi nante daikirai

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:52.020
I hate that smell after it rains

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:48.930
I won't give up!

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.300
I love this city!

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:54.060
I love these people!

00:11:52.590 --> 00:12:02.770
aa kono mama hitori de isasete

00:11:52.590 --> 00:12:02.770
Yeah, just let me be alone now

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:55.890
I'll do everything in my power!

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.100
I am who I am!

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:04.090
Citron!

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:12.120
Falcon...

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.700
Not gonna give up, are you, young lady?

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:23.250
namagawaki no fuku no  sode wo nigirishimete

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:23.250
I wring out the sleeves of my partially dry clothes

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:30.010
heya no sumi nesoberi  ryoume gyutto tojita

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:30.010
Sprawl in the corner and screw my eyes shut

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:28.420
Dan!

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:30.010
Iceman!

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:36.770
karamitsuku shitsuon ni  kimi no koto kasanete

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:36.770
The room's warm air coils around me, with some of you twined in

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:33.530
Sorry, Slash.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:36.310
I'm not the guy you thought I was.

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:43.830
samesou na nukumori wo tojikometakattanda

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:43.830
I wanted to lock away that warmth that might cool me off

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:41.020
This is who I am!

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:49.070
konnani atsui no ni  furueteru

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:49.070
Even in this heat, I'm trembling

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:45.820
Basquash.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.440
Who art thou?

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:57.290
ame ga agatta ato no nioi nante daikirai

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:57.290
I hate that smell after it rains

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.910
The owner of the voice I hear...

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:56.250
...may be surprisingly close to us now.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.110
Does that mean...?

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:03.470
guuzen no nokoriga  kesarechaisou

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:03.470
An accidental perfume that might vanish any minute

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:02.040
The source of the voice...is there.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:10.720
kimi ga fureta  sono isshun wo omou dake de

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:10.670
Just thinking of that instant when you touched me-

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:05.130
The Legend Bullet.

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:20.140
toozakaru amaoto to mune no douki  hora hibikiau

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:20.140
The fading rain-patter echoes and re-echoes the pounding in my chest

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:12.770
I see it...

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.760
I can see what Flora is seeing,

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:17.850
feel what she's feeling...

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:23.190
The gods...

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:31.020
I'm afraid even Slash can't survive becoming this cute.

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:37.460
gurasu ippai no mizu  kimi wo tokashichatte

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:37.460
If only I could get a full glass of water, and dissolve you in it

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:35.830
Thank you for looking after my brother.

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:37.890
I don't look after him.

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:44.390
sotto hitokuchi zutsu  nonde shimaetara na

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:44.390
And drink you up one slow mouthful at a time

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:40.220
If anything, I'm grateful to you.

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.350
Grateful?

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:51.240
soba ni ite  itsu datte  sakibashiru kanjou

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:51.240
Stay by me... My feelings always run on ahead of me

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.130
I have to go.

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:49.750
I'm sure there must be something left that I can do.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:53.590
That's what Dan and Slash have taught me.

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:58.050
modokashiku sekitomeru hifu sae mo jama ni naru

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:58.050
And then even my skin is a maddening obstacle

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:57.890
Enjoy your court side seat, Ultimate Bystander.

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:03.690
shiritai  zenshin de nani mo ka mo

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:03.690
I want to feel, with my whole body,
 everything that might come

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:04.080
I am the king of the Skybloom Kingdom, Regalia the 13th.

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:11.530
sora ni kakatta niji no hashi da nante daikirai

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:11.530
I hate that stupid rainbow bridge on the sky

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:06.150
My orders are thus.

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:10.500
Lift your guard of the Palace and guide the refugees here!

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:13.600
What kind of kingdom locks the people out?!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:18.020
dare hitori tsurete wa kurenai kuse ni

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:18.020
There's not one of you 
would take me along when you cross it

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:14.820
Sire!

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:18.590
"Who art thou?"

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:25.120
kireigoto de nurikomerareta genjitsu yori

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:25.090
Compared to reality, plastered over with platitudes,

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:20.270
Yes.

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:22.120
I am a king.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:25.590
And because I am king, it is incumbent on me to hear the voice of my people...

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:34.450
himegoto mo yurusareru 
haiiro no umi ni oboreru no

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:34.450
I'd rather drown in an ash-grey sea 
where secrets can be spoken

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:29.290
That's what the stones have been crying to me all along.

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.420
Just as you were.

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:33.860
Father!

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:39.460
Flora.

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:41.950
Sister?

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:46.250
Father and I can feel you through the stones.

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:59.420
shimekitta mado no mukou  
seijaku ga sekai wo tsutsumu

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:59.420
One side of the tight-shut window, 
silence enfolds the world

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:48.010
I see...

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:49.900
Of course you can.

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:52.320
The stones are alive.

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:55.740
And all things are connected.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:57.990
Now I get it.

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:00.070
So they're alive!

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:09.460
sashikondeku usui hikari  
onegai konaide

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:09.300
A weak beam of light pokes in;
 please, light, stay away

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:02.110
Never saw that coming!

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.200
And you are?

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:04.820
Thousand.

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:07.500
People call me the woman who delves for truth.

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:09.650
What?

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:11.890
hitori de isasete

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:11.890
Let me be alone

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:10.710
I see...

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.920
I never thought science would give myth a helping hand.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:19.330
ame ga agatta ato no nioi nante daikirai

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:19.330
I hate that smell after it rains

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:15.830
How ironic.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.170
Iceman!

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:25.560
guuzen no nokoriga  kesarechaisou

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:25.560
An accidental perfume that might vanish any minute

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:23.790
Dan...

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:32.700
kimi ga fureta 
 sono isshun wo omou dake de

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:32.700
Just thinking of that instant 
when you touched me-

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:30.100
Navi!

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:33.110
Sela!

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:42.950
toozakaru amaoto to mune 
no douki  hora hibikiau

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:42.950
The fading rain-patter echoes and 
re-echoes the pounding in my chest

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:50.370
Sela, you're moving easier than before.

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:52.440
That's right...

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:56.090
This is what I was after all along.

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:58.470
Chasing desperately after that ball...

00:15:58.470 --> 00:15:59.650
And now...

